      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 8.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "Hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second. So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.02,
      "end_seconds": 21.86,
      "duration_seconds": 11.84,
      "text": "I, I wanted to get red, cracked skin on my hands looked at my family kept telling me to get it it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.12,
      "end_seconds": 26.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.82,
      "end_seconds": 33.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "ah, it's been going on for about a month"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.7,
      "end_seconds": 42.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.19,
      "end_seconds": 49.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "only moisturiser, and it's not much. It's worse with washing hands"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.97,
      "end_seconds": 53.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Any blisters between your fingers as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.02,
      "end_seconds": 72.53,
      "duration_seconds": 18.51,
      "text": "yes, you know, about the same, about three months so, you know, there's itching as well yeah, with itching, a eight out of ten, I suppose i get some relief from a cool cloth"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.85,
      "end_seconds": 85.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
