    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.4,
      "end_seconds": 97.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.54,
      "end_seconds": 121.97,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 77 beats a minute, respiratory rate 17, pressure 109 over 78. And weight 75 kilos, temperature is 36.8 degrees, saturation 98 percent, height 165 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.16,
      "end_seconds": 126.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.11,
      "end_seconds": 130.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.57,
      "end_seconds": 146.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "The skin on both hands is red, dry and cracked in the finger creases, with no weeping."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.89,
      "end_seconds": 159.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "You can relax now. Okay, any new soap or cream, nail changes or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.39,
      "end_seconds": 168.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.87,
      "end_seconds": 172.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Have you had joint pain, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.56,
      "end_seconds": 175.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Definitely no joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.03,
      "end_seconds": 180.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.75,
      "end_seconds": 187.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.8,
      "end_seconds": 192.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.95,
      "end_seconds": 197.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "mm, no, my breathing's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.34,
      "end_seconds": 201.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.74,
      "end_seconds": 216.31,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.67,
      "end_seconds": 229.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.69,
      "end_seconds": 236.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, no, I've never reacted to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.55,
      "end_seconds": 252.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "So, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.98,
      "end_seconds": 263.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "So, it's hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. It's moisturiser, several times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.86,
      "end_seconds": 267.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.13,
      "end_seconds": 271.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Mm, um, no, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.23,
      "end_seconds": 276.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "So, do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.67,
      "end_seconds": 280.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "I've got eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.18,
      "end_seconds": 297.65,
      "duration_seconds": 15.47,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this looks most like irritant hand dermatitis. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I'd also keep a fungal skin infection in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.68,
      "end_seconds": 303.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "what are the the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.23,
      "end_seconds": 320.85,
      "duration_seconds": 15.62,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like irritant hand dermatitis, but I'd like to confirm. I'm gonna order a patch test, for dermatitis. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.55,
      "end_seconds": 326.36,
